{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_155_1000_p", "source_sha256": "9d81ab5d48d6ce235d811513b844c376b3dbef8b301946174be9cd5600e5226b", "ja": "（こうして、琴葉が共演者の方に頂いたチケットで\n観劇する事になった）", "zh": "（就这样，琴叶拿着共演者送给她的票，决定去看戏了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
