{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_155_1002_p", "source_sha256": "985feab8c2ccb99eeac4049fa6bbd8e4b2fb7a09d4db02f2605fd1c4970cd6c3", "ja": "（舞台は引き込まれる内容で、見応えがあった。\n終演後、琴葉と一緒に楽屋へご挨拶に伺った……）", "zh": "（舞台内容引人入胜，非常值得一看。演出结束后，我和琴叶一起去后台打招呼了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_155_1003_017kth", "source_sha256": "0318bc8ccb30b82bc787d1d49a714f52dc24d8d1a55377465c31b3d5c57f60ba", "ja": "本当に素晴らしい舞台でした！　いえ！\n素晴らしいなんて言葉じゃ足りないくらいです！", "zh": "真是一场精彩绝伦的演出！不！\n精彩绝伦都不足以形容它！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_155_1004_017kth", "source_sha256": "6bce950939e49811d98645b531ff818d9fd4f21666748e01ac1805a647bcef91", "ja": "感情の込め方、台詞の緩急のつけ方、ふとした仕草や\n表情にも役の心情がしっかりと表れていて！", "zh": "情感的投入、台词抑扬顿挫的处理，还有不经意间的动作和表情，都充分展现出了角色的心情！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_155_1005_017kth", "source_sha256": "3a77a91036998ee64427824d26d3f3ad8bb18e653ca7b7d12414b12c34554106", "ja": "演じているというより役そのものでした！\nカッコよくて眩しくて、勉強になるところばかりで！", "zh": "与其说是在演绎，不如说你就是那个角色本身！  \n又帅气又耀眼，处处都值得我学习！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_155_1007_hiyama", "source_sha256": "a4add717064123832df6cfd69e7d0b56021a5412ca85886b609fbf75189c2e7b", "ja": "ふっ、ふふふっ。", "zh": "呵、呵呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_155_1008_017kth", "source_sha256": "01197abf2cb9339d9b38e896dcbb013e07341504f146e653251df2b34fbc4101", "ja": "あ……すみません！\n私ったら、ひとりでベラベラと……。", "zh": "啊……对不起！\n我真是的，竟然一个人自顾自地说个不停……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_155_1009_hiyama", "source_sha256": "46123c1953bf91b4fc5b2c1cbf50208a585cbf4c4e18eeda6cf0406dbfebb382", "ja": "田中さん。\n貴方、本当にお芝居が好きなのね。", "zh": "田中小姐。\n你真的很喜欢演戏呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_155_1010_017kth", "source_sha256": "87ca8af667f93d2028ebdf844f4d0e8e6b26cf7ca22c0b58a75df30f8c0d4e54", "ja": "うう、やっちゃいました…………。\nどうしよう、恥ずかしい……。", "zh": "呜，我搞砸了…………。\n怎么办，好丢人……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_155_1011_p", "source_sha256": "1a70e5c1f2bbd7d2630715a6f906fb457a15a97ababac09dd91f51a84eb2d432", "ja": "いいじゃないか。\n琴葉の感想、喜んでくれてたと思うよ。", "zh": "挺好的嘛。\n我觉得对方听了琴叶的感想也很高兴哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_155_1012_017kth", "source_sha256": "f157e190f4cd0c3ce99b14f074868a2e6efc6b831269843208c502fc95093a36", "ja": "だといいんですけど……。でも、今日のお芝居を観て、\n私なんてまだまだだって、改めて思いました。", "zh": "要是那样就好了……不过，看了今天的戏剧，我再次觉得自己还差得远。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_155_1013_017kth", "source_sha256": "1dc05f4358016ec95ceec0bbdc6f0a02217112a75d88180a2bc596e1f714b4c3", "ja": "だから、もっともっとがんばります。\n憧れの存在に、少しでも近づけるように。", "zh": "所以，我会更加努力。\n为了哪怕能更接近憧憬的那个人一点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_155_1014_p", "source_sha256": "be4ba279e8990277bf854ffaff5d1aa2d95955f1706012ac0a23e2ac9a1b0930", "ja": "ああ、そうだな。\nひとつひとつ積み重ねていこう。", "zh": "啊，是啊。\n一步一步积累起来吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_155_1015_017kth", "source_sha256": "d63bc7d27b6463dc39b0c0a078cbe159188ac53228ed6c3ecc6aa9269cbd4bc2", "ja": "はい。……あの、{$P$}。\n私、本当はすこし、怖かったんです。", "zh": "是的。……那个，{$P$}。\n其实，我有一点害怕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_155_1016_017kth", "source_sha256": "0fac59c3078a753861d441455b46b8e4383b635716215d297fdc3af9fc883008", "ja": "役をもらえたのは、\n私がアイドルだからだ、って言われて。", "zh": "有人对我说，能拿到这个角色，\n全是因为我是偶像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_155_1017_017kth", "source_sha256": "2114e5fe788812f0cb51c928a101ac3e5797445d1c4c981a6f267c5b22587313", "ja": "自分では、精いっぱいやっているつもりでしたけど。\n……本当のことは、私にはわからないから。", "zh": "我本来以为自己已经竭尽全力了。……因为我自己也不知道，真正的情况到底是什么。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_155_1019_017kth", "source_sha256": "568ddc777b4657fdcc76c6cb8eec0e4155f5281133db306a89bec02b592882f5", "ja": "だから、もし、私がアイドルじゃなかったとしたら……\nこの役をもらえたのかなって、考えると不安になって。", "zh": "所以，我会不安地想，要是我不是偶像的话……还能得到这个角色吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_155_1020_017kth", "source_sha256": "38ea741ca8a7aeff1e18878d0e2b7b5434c7f70554fcb558d3cd579d221dc09a", "ja": "アイドルじゃない私を、\nみんなは見つけてくれるのかなって……。", "zh": "如果不是偶像的我，\n大家还会发现我吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
