{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_155_1022_p", "source_sha256": "50f210cfcb81f2d99e5bc527615a9e86106991cad43af4abf585a9991285ff75", "ja": "俳優ではなくアイドルとして、\n活動をしていきたい？", "zh": "不是当演员，而是想继续以偶像的身份活动下去吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
